    "You are on the fediverse" : "Ste na fediverse",
    "Your Nextcloud made you an account. This is your address — anyone on Mastodon, Pixelfed, PeerTube or any other server that speaks ActivityPub can follow it:" : "Vaš Nextcloud vam je ustvaril račun. To je vaš naslov – kdor koli na Mastodonu, Pixelfedu, PeerTube ali katerem koli drugem strežniku, ki govori ActivityPub, mu lahko sledi:",
    "Copied" : "Kopirano",
    "Copy" : "Kopiraj",
    "Give it to people the way you would an email address. Your profile, your avatar and your name come from your Nextcloud account and can be changed on your profile page." : "Dajte ga ljudem tako, kot bi dali e-poštni naslov. Vaš profil, vaš avatar in vaše ime prihajajo iz vašega računa Nextcloud in jih je mogoče spremeniti na strani vašega profila.",
    "A feed is only as good as who is in it" : "Vir je tako dober, kot kdo je v njem",
