    "People on your Nextcloud" : "Ljudje na vašem Nextcloudu",
    "Looking around …" : "Pogled okoli …",
    "Nobody on this Nextcloud has said where they are on the fediverse yet. You are the first — your handle is now on your Nextcloud profile, so the next person will see you here." : "Nihče na tem Nextcloudu še ni povedal, kje je na fediverse. Vi ste prvi — vaš naslov je zdaj na vašem profilu Nextcloud, zato vas bo naslednja oseba videla tukaj.",
    "Starter packs" : "Začetni paketi",
    "No starter packs on this server. Discover has suggestions and what is trending." : "Na tem strežniku ni začetnih paketov. Discover ima predloge in kaj je v trendu.",
    "Already somewhere else?" : "Že kje drugje?",
    "If you have an account on Mastodon or another server, bring the people you follow. Mastodon and servers like it export them as following_accounts.csv, Pixelfed as pixelfed-following.json — upload that file and each one is followed from here." : "Če imate račun na Mastodonu ali drugem strežniku, pripeljite ljudi, ki jim sledite. Mastodon in njemu podobni strežniki jih izvozijo kot follow_accounts.csv, Pixelfed kot pixelfed-following.json — naložite to datoteko in vsaki sledite od tukaj.",
    "Following …" : "Spremljanje ...",
    "Upload your follows" : "Naložite svoje sledilce",
    "On Mastodon: Preferences → Import and export → Data export → Follows (CSV). Moving your followers over as well is in Settings, under Migration — that one is a one-way move, so it is not a button here." : "Na Mastodonu: Nastavitve → Uvoz in izvoz → Izvoz podatkov → Sledi (CSV). Premikanje vaših sledilcev je tudi v nastavitvah, pod selitvijo - to je enosmerno premikanje, zato tukaj ni gumba.",
    "That is all there is to it" : "To je vse",
    "Your feed fills up as the people you follow post. Meanwhile, say hello — a first post is how the fediverse finds out you are here." : "Vaš vir se polni, ko ljudje, ki jih spremljate, objavljajo. Medtem pa pozdravite - prva objava je način, kako fediverse izve, da ste tukaj.",
