    "Until this is on, the page is a draft only you can see. Once it is on, anybody with the link can read it without signing in — which is the point of it." : "Dokler ni vklopljeno, je stran osnutek, ki ga lahko vidite samo vi. Ko je vklopljen, ga lahko bere vsak s povezavo, ne da bi se prijavil - kar je bistvo tega.",
