    "Who may quote it" : "Kdo ga sme citirati",
    "This decides what happens from now on. It does not take back a quote somebody has already posted — use the list below for that." : "To odloča, kaj se bo zgodilo od zdaj naprej. Ne prevzame citata, ki ga je nekdo že objavil - za to uporabite spodnji seznam.",
    "Who has quoted it" : "Kdo ga je citiral",
