    "Detaching tells the other server, which then shows the quote as withdrawn. The post itself is theirs and stays where it is." : "Odklop sporoči drugemu strežniku, ki nato ponudbo prikaže kot umaknjeno. Sama objava je njihova in ostane tam, kjer je.",
    "This quote is waiting for the quoted author to approve it." : "Ta citat čaka, da ga citirani avtor odobri.",
