    "A line at the top of your feed, once a week, saying how many times you posted. Nobody else sees it, and there is no streak to keep up." : "Vrstica na vrhu vašega vira, enkrat na teden, ki pove, kolikokrat ste objavili. Nihče drug tega ne vidi in ni niza, ki bi ga lahko obdržal.",
