    "Nothing is waiting to be posted. The clock in the composer schedules a post for later." : "Nič ne čaka na objavo. Ura v skladatelju načrtuje objavo za pozneje.",
    "Search results for “{term}”" : "Rezultati iskanja za “{term}”",
    "Searching …" : "Iskanje …",
    "Nothing on this server matches “{term}”. Searching for a full handle like @user@example.org can find somebody this server has not met yet." : "Nič na tem strežniku se ne ujema z »{term}«. Če iščete celotno oznako, kot je @user@example.org, lahko najdete nekoga, ki ga ta strežnik še ni srečal.",
    "People" : "Ljudje",
    "Hashtags" : "Hashtags",
    "Posts" : "Objave",
    "Play sounds" : "Predvajaj zvoke",
    "Listen" : "poslušaj",
    "A soft tick when you like something, a breath of air when a post goes out, and a two-note chime when a direct message arrives. Off until you turn it on." : "Mehka kljukica, ko vam je nekaj všeč, vdih zraka, ko objava izgine, in dvotonski zvonec, ko prispe neposredno sporočilo. Izklopljen, dokler ga ne vklopite.",
    "Vibrate" : "Vibriraj",
    "A short tap in the hand on a phone when you like, boost, react or post. Your system setting for less motion turns it off as well." : "Kratek dotik z roko po telefonu, ko vam je všeč, povečate, reagirate ali objavite. Vaša sistemska nastavitev za manj gibanja ga tudi izklopi.",
    "Social needs the .well-known automatic discovery to be properly set up. If Nextcloud is not installed in the root of the domain, it is often the case that Nextcloud cannot configure this automatically. To use Social, the administrator of this Nextcloud instance needs to manually configure the .well-known redirects:" : "Social potrebuje pravilno nastavljeno samodejno odkrivanje .well-known. Če Nextcloud ni nameščen v korenu domene, se pogosto zgodi, da Nextcloud tega ne more samodejno konfigurirati. Če želite uporabljati Social, mora skrbnik tega primerka Nextcloud ročno konfigurirati preusmeritve .well-known:",
    "Mastodon apps cannot connect to this server" : "Aplikacije Mastodon se ne morejo povezati s tem strežnikom",
    "The web server has to map /api, /oauth and two /.well-known paths onto Social. It has to do that as an internal proxy and not as a redirect: Nextcloud routes on the address a request arrived at, so a plain rewrite answers 404, and many clients drop their authorization when they follow a redirect. Inside the Apache virtual host that serves Nextcloud:" : "Spletni strežnik mora preslikati /api, /oauth in dve /.well-known poti na Social. To mora storiti kot interni proxy in ne kot preusmeritev: Nextcloud usmerja na naslov, na katerega je prispela zahteva, tako da navadno prepisovanje odgovori 404 in veliko strank opusti avtorizacijo, ko sledijo preusmeritvi. Znotraj virtualnega gostitelja Apache, ki služi Nextcloud:",
    "Whatever the rules proxy to has to serve this Nextcloud itself. A host or port that serves a different document root — one with no virtual host for this domain, say — answers 404 for every proxied request, which looks exactly like having no rules at all. An Apache 404 page names the port it came from, which tells the two apart." : "Ne glede na proxy pravila, mora služiti temu Nextcloudu. Gostitelj ali vrata, ki strežejo drugačen koren dokumenta – na primer brez navideznega gostitelja za to domeno – odgovorijo 404 za vsako proksi zahtevo, kar je videti natanko tako, kot da sploh nima pravil. Stran Apache 404 poimenuje vrata, iz katerih je prišla, kar jih ločuje.",
    "The rules for nginx, what each one is for, and what else changes once requests arrive through a proxy are in the documentation. Nothing else is affected: the web interface and federation with other servers work without any of this." : "Pravila za nginx, čemu je vsako namenjeno in kaj se še spremeni, ko zahteve prispejo prek posrednika, so v dokumentaciji. Nič drugega ni prizadeto: spletni vmesnik in povezava z drugimi strežniki delujeta brez tega.",
    "Social is set up for a different address than this server" : "Družabno omrežje je nastavljeno za drug naslov kot ta strežnik",
    "Changing it renames every account and post that already exists here, so Social will not do it on its own. Either point the server back at the address Social knows, or reset Social with \"occ social:reset\" — which deletes everything it holds." : "Če ga spremenite, se preimenuje vsak račun in objava, ki že obstaja tukaj, zato Social tega ne bo storil sam. Usmerite strežnik nazaj na naslov, ki ga pozna Social, ali ponastavite Social z \"occ social:reset\" — ki izbriše vse, kar ima.",
