    "The post is removed everywhere it reached, and its words, pictures and content warning are put back in the composer. What you post next is a new post: the boosts, likes and replies this one collected stay with it and are gone." : "Objava je odstranjena povsod, kamor je dosegla, njene besede, slike in opozorila o vsebini pa so vrnjeni v pisatelja. Kar objavite naslednje, je nova objava: povečanja, všečki in odgovori, ki jih je ta zbrala, ostanejo z njo in izginejo.",
