    "When your account is locked, people asking to follow you show up here." : "Ko je vaš račun zaklenjen, se ljudje, ki želijo slediti, prikažejo tukaj.",
    "Change that in your account settings." : "To spremenite v nastavitvah računa.",
    "Reject" : "Zavrni",
    "Load more" : "Naloži več",
    "Your account is yours. Take a copy of it whenever you like, move it to another server, or bring one here from somewhere else — including the posts you wrote there, with their pictures." : "Tvoj račun je tvoj. Kadar koli želite, naredite kopijo, jo premaknite na drug strežnik ali jo prinesite sem od nekje drugje – vključno z objavami, ki ste jih tam napisali, z njihovimi slikami.",
