    "What you have posted here, and what came back. Counted from this server when you opened the page, so it is never a stale number." : "Kaj ste objavili tukaj in kaj se je vrnilo. Šteje se s tega strežnika, ko odprete stran, tako da nikoli ni zastarela številka.",
