    "got no answer" : "ni dobil odgovora",
    "A floor rather than a total: a like on a server that never told this one about it cannot be counted anywhere. There are no impressions to divide by either, so the rate is against your follower count." : "Nadstropje namesto vsote: všečkov na strežniku, ki tega ni nikoli povedal temu, ni mogoče šteti nikjer. Prav tako ni prikazov, s katerimi bi lahko delili, zato je stopnja glede na vaše število sledilcev.",
