    "When your posts do best" : "Ko so vaše objave najboljše",
    "Not enough posts at any one hour to say yet — it takes three in the same hour before this is more than luck." : "Ni dovolj objav v eni uri, da bi še povedali - potrebne so tri v isti uri, preden je to več kot sreča.",
