    "posted in the last month" : "objavljeno v zadnjem mesecu",
    "What the fediverse runs on" : "Na čem deluje fediverse",
    "How the fediverse has grown" : "Kako je fediverse zrasel",
    "Accounts, month by month" : "Računi, mesec za mesecem",
    "A step in this line is usually the survey reaching servers it had not reached before, rather than the network changing size — so no year-on-year figure is shown for a year that has one in it." : "Korak v tej vrstici je navadno raziskava, ki doseže strežnike, ki jih prej ni dosegla, in ne sprememba velikosti omrežja – tako da za leto, ki ga ima, ni prikazana številka iz leta v leto.",
    "What you did" : "Kaj si naredil",
    "Everything above counts what came back to you. This counts what you did: a quiet month here is a month you did not post, not a month nobody answered." : "Vse zgoraj šteje tisto, kar se vam je vrnilo. To šteje, kar ste storili: miren mesec tukaj je mesec, ko niste objavili, ne mesec, na katerega nihče ni odgovoril.",
    "How steadily you post" : "Kako vztrajno objavljate",
    "days you posted on" : "dni, ko ste objavili",
