    "Your pictures" : "Tvoje slike",
    "carry a description" : "nositi opis",
    "{done} of {all}" : "{done} od {all}",
    "A picture without a description is a picture nobody using a screen reader can read. This is the one number on the page you can move on your own." : "Slika brez opisa je slika, ki jo nihče ne more prebrati z bralnikom zaslona. To je ena številka na strani, ki jo lahko premaknete sami.",
    "What you write, and what you point at" : "Kaj pišeš in na kaj kažeš",
