    "_{days} day. Directly comparable._::_{days} days. Directly comparable._" : ["{days} dan. Neposredno primerljiv.", "{days} dni. Neposredno primerljiv.", "{days} dni. Neposredno primerljiv.", "{days} dni. Neposredno primerljiv."],
    "_picture posted_::_pictures posted_" : ["objavljena slika", "objavljene slike", "objavljene slike", "objavljene slike"],
    "Settings → Your account → Download an archive of your data, and wait for the mail. Your posts and their pictures are in it. The accounts you followed are in it only as numbers, so there is nobody in that file to look up — and nothing on X federates, so no follower can come with you." : "Nastavitve → Vaš račun → Prenesite arhiv svojih podatkov in počakajte na pošto. V njej so vaše objave in njihove slike. Računi, ki ste jim sledili, so v njem samo kot številke, tako da v tej datoteki ni nikogar, ki bi ga lahko poiskal — in nič na X združuje, tako da noben sledilec ne more iti z vami.",
    "Settings → Accounts Centre → Your information and permissions → Download your information, and choose JSON. The HTML download holds the pages and not the posts. Your posts, your reels and the list of accounts you follow are all in that one file." : "Nastavitve → Središče za račune → Vaši podatki in dovoljenja → Prenesite svoje podatke in izberite JSON. Prenos HTML vsebuje strani in ne objav. Vaše objave, vaši koluti in seznam računov, ki jim sledite, so v eni datoteki.",
    "Settings → Account → Download your data. The archive holds your videos as files rather than as posts, so there is nothing here that can read it as a timeline yet." : "Nastavitve → Račun → Prenesite svoje podatke. Arhiv hrani vaše videoposnetke kot datoteke in ne kot objave, zato tukaj še ni ničesar, kar bi jih lahko prebralo kot časovnico.",
    "TikTok posts cannot be imported from the archive yet. A video at a time can still be brought over by its address from Settings → Moving in, and everything below this step works the same." : "TikTok objav še ni mogoče uvoziti iz arhiva. Posamezni videoposnetek je še vedno mogoče prenesti z naslovom iz Nastavitve → Vselitev in vse pod tem korakom deluje enako.",
    "Google Takeout → YouTube and YouTube Music. The archive holds your videos as files rather than as posts, so there is nothing here that can read it as a timeline yet." : "Google Arhiviranje → YouTube in YouTube Music. Arhiv hrani vaše videoposnetke kot datoteke in ne kot objave, zato tukaj še ni ničesar, kar bi jih lahko prebralo kot časovnico.",
    "Your own uploads are yours to re-publish rather than something to import in bulk — they are whole videos, and each one belongs on a post you write." : "Svoje lastne naložene videoposnetke lahko znova objavite, namesto da jih uvozite v velikem obsegu – to so celi videoposnetki in vsak sodi v objavo, ki jo napišete.",
    "_Brought over %n post._::_Brought over %n posts._" : ["Preneseno več kot %n objava.", "Prinesel več kot %n objav.", "Prinesel več kot %n objav.", "Prinesel več kot %n objav."],
    "There are more: run it again to carry on." : "Obstaja več: zaženite ga znova, da nadaljujete.",
    "That archive could not be read" : "Tega arhiva ni bilo mogoče prebrati",
    "That archive lists nobody to look up" : "V tem arhivu ni nikogar, ki bi ga bilo treba poiskati",
    "Could not look those names up" : "Teh imen ni bilo mogoče najti",
    "Could not follow those accounts" : "Teh računov ni bilo mogoče spremljati",
    "I have moved to the fediverse" : "Preselil sem se na fediverse",
    "Follow me from any fediverse account — no account here needed" : "Spremljajte me iz katerega koli računa fediverse — račun tukaj ni potreben",
    "Could not copy — the words are below, to select" : "Ni bilo mogoče kopirati — besede so spodaj, da jih izberete",
    "Move in from somewhere else" : "Vselite se od drugod",
    "Your posts, the people you follow and a way to tell everyone where you went. Nothing here is posted for you, and nothing leaves this server except the lookups you ask for." : "Vaše objave, ljudje, ki jim sledite, in način, da vsem poveste, kam ste bili. Tukaj ni nič objavljeno za vas in nič ne zapusti tega strežnika, razen iskanj, ki jih zahtevate.",
    "Where are you coming from?" : "od kod prihajaš",
    "Bring your posts" : "Prinesite svoje objave",
    "Reading your archive …" : "Branje vašega arhiva …",
    "Choose your archive" : "Izberite svoj arhiv",
    "Your posts are written here with the dates they were written on, and nothing is sent to anyone: importing cannot put years of old posts into other people's timelines." : "Vaše objave so tukaj zapisane z datumi, ko so bile napisane, in nič ni poslano nikomur: uvoz ne more prenesti let starih objav na časovnice drugih ljudi.",
    "Find the people you followed" : "Poiščite osebe, ki ste jim sledili",
    "Instagram names are Threads names, and Threads is part of the fediverse — so the accounts you already followed can be looked up here, one at a time, from the same archive. Everyone who answers is shown; nobody is followed until you say so." : "Imena Instagrama so imena Threads in Threads je del fediverse — tako da lahko račune, ki jim že sledite, poiščete tukaj, enega za drugim, iz istega arhiva. Prikazani so vsi, ki odgovorijo; nihče ne sledi, dokler tega ne rečeš.",
    "Read the list from my archive" : "Preberi seznam iz mojega arhiva",
    "Choose your archive above first" : "Najprej izberite svoj arhiv zgoraj",
    "Keep looking" : "Išči naprej",
    "Fill your feed" : "Izpolnite vir",
    "A timeline here is what you followed and nothing else — there is no algorithm deciding what you get. Which means the first day is yours to fill: the starter packs are handfuls of accounts by subject, and following a hashtag brings in everyone who writes about it, whether you follow them or not." : "Časovnica je tisto, čemur ste sledili, in nič drugega – noben algoritem ne odloča, kaj dobite. Kar pomeni, da je prvi dan vaš: začetni paketi so peščice računov po temah in sledenje hashtagu pripelje vse, ki pišejo o tem, ne glede na to, ali jim sledite ali ne.",
    "Browse starter packs" : "Brskajte po začetnih paketih",
    "Follow hashtags" : "Sledite hashtagom",
    "Tell people where you went" : "Povej ljudem, kam si šel",
    "The one part nobody can do for you: none of those networks lets another site post on your behalf. Here is the card and the words — put them where you used to be, once, and the people still there can find you." : "En del, ki ga nihče ne more storiti namesto vas: nobeno od teh omrežij ne dovoli drugemu mestu objavljati v vašem imenu. Tukaj je kartica in besede — postavite jih tja, kjer ste nekoč bili, in ljudje, ki so še tam, vas bodo lahko našli.",
    "A card naming your new account" : "Kartica z imenom vašega novega računa",
    "Your address could not be read, so the card and the words are not ready yet." : "Vašega naslova ni bilo mogoče prebrati, zato kartica in besede še niso pripravljene.",
    "Save the card" : "Shranite kartico",
    "Copy the words" : "Prepiši besede",
